{"id": "zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov", "source": "archiv", "date": "2023-02-19T12:39:36", "title": "Nábor nových hráčov 2023", "excerpt": "Náborová výzva pre deti, juniorov aj seniorov zo sezóny 2023.", "thumb": "assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/012.jpg", "category": "archiv", "html": "<p class=\"has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#0e2a1c;background-color:#f5c400;padding-top:12px;padding-right:16px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:16px\">Archívny článok – aktuálne tréningy a kontakty nájdeš na <a href=\"/\">úvodnej stránke</a>.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e3ebe4;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p><strong>Kedy:</strong> sezóna 2023<br><strong>Kategórie:</strong> Deti, juniori, seniori</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Čo potrebuješ na tréning?</strong></h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Chceš sa dostať do formy a vstúpiť do džentlmenskej hry pod skúseným, certifikovaným trénerom?</li>\n\n<li>Predošlé skúsenosti v rugby nie sú potrebné</li>\n\n<li>Je jedno čí si fit alebo nie, dvere sú otvorené pre všetkých, ktorý chcú na sebe makať</li>\n\n<li>Prines si športové oblečenie (bežecké topánky, kraťasy a tričko)</li>\n\n<li>Tešíme sa na teba a vidíme sa na ihrisku Žilinskej univerzity za OC Dubeň (<strong>&nbsp;tréning je zdarma</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kategórie:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>deti</li>\n\n<li>juniori</li>\n\n<li>seniori</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fotky</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/tournament-rugby-league/001.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/002.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/003.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders/021.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rugby-akademia-v-ziline-pre-juniorov/001.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/006.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/007.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/008.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/stale-hladame-novych-hracov-do-vsetkych-kategorii-zilina-bears-rugby-club/011.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Zobraziť všetky fotky (11)</summary>\n<a href=\"assets/archive/tournament-rugby-league/001.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/tournament-rugby-league/001.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/002.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/002.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/003.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/zilina-bears-rugby-club-2023-nabor-novych-hracov/003.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:8px\"></a><a href=\"assets/archive/rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders/021.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders/021.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;heigh